<p>#4.查看 Hysteria 日志</p>
<pre class="line-numbers language-javascript" data-language="javascript"><code class="language-javascript">sudo journalctl <span class="token operator">-</span>u hysteria<span class="token operator">-</span>server<span class="token punctuation">.</span>service <span class="token operator">-</span>e <span class="token operator">--</span>no<span class="token operator">-</span>pager

