<h1 id="导入到shadowrocket"><a href="#导入到shadowrocket" class="headerlink" title="导入到shadowrocket"></a>导入到shadowrocket</h1><pre class="line-numbers language-javascript" data-language="javascript"><code class="language-javascript"><span class="token literal-property property">hysteria2</span><span class="token operator">:</span><span class="token operator">/</span><span class="token operator">/</span>authpassword@域名<span class="token operator">:</span><span class="token number">443</span><span class="token operator">/</span><span class="token operator">?</span>obfs<span class="token operator">=</span>salamander<span class="token operator">&amp;</span>obfs<span class="token operator">-</span>password<span class="token operator">=</span>obfspassword#Oracle<span class="token operator">-</span><span class="token constant">HY2</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre>

